.Fn EVP_PKEY_verify_init_ex2 ,
.Fn EVP_PKEY_verify_message_init ,
.Fn EVP_PKEY_verify_message_update ,
.Fn EVP_PKEY_verify_message_final
and
.Fn EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_signature
functions where added in OpenSSL 3.4.
